 108   007600  7604  SBOOT,  LAS                     /GET UNIT FROM SWITCHES
 109   007601  0214          AND     SRWAIT/(7000)   /JUST UNIT BITS
 110   007602  1213          TAD     SR600/(600)     /GET REWIND VALUE
 111   007603  4214          JMS     SRWAIT          /WAIT FOR END ZONE
 112   007604  6774          DTLB                    /ENSURE FIELD 0 TRANSFER
 113   007605  3354          DCA     SWC             /CLEAR WORD COUNT
 114   007606  1221          TAD     SR7577/(SBOOT-1)/SETUP THE
 115   007607  3355          DCA     SCAA            /CURRENT ADDRESS
