 122   007615  6766          DTLA                    /LOAD "A" REGISTER
 123   007616  6771          DTSF                    /FLAG UP?
 124   007617  5216          JMP     .-1             /NO, WAIT FOR IT
 125   007620  5614          JMP I   SRWAIT          /YES, RETURN
