 132           7615          *7615                   /OVER WAIT AREA
 133   
 134   007615  7604          LAS                     /GET SWITCHES
 135   007616  6766          DTLA                    /LOAD "A" REGISTER
 136   007617  5217          JMP     .               /WAIT FOR TRANSFER
 137   
 138           7754          *7754                   /AT WORD COUNT AREA
